218
00:11:29,567 --> 00:11:34,987
Gue pengin cerita kalau udah mulai gelisah.

219
00:11:35,567 --> 00:11:36,287
Ngerasa gelisa.

220
00:11:36,447 --> 00:11:42,187
Kalau di otak udah numpuk, gue
ngerasa, “Ini gue perlu cerita.”

221
00:11:42,327 --> 00:11:45,407
Tapi kalau misalkan, ya kalau
biasanya kan gue cuma capek doang.

222
00:11:45,567 --> 00:11:48,347
Aduh capek gue malas nih
gapapa-gapain, udah gue diem bisa.

223
00:11:48,407 --> 00:11:52,272
Cuma kalau misalnya kan, gue pengen
cerita banget tuh kalau gue udah ngerasa

224
00:11:52,307 --> 00:11:53,027
Gelisah

225
00:11:59,007 --> 00:12:02,067
Coba, Mut. Gimana nih, Mut?

226
00:12:02,707 --> 00:12:04,967
Ya mode. Gue bikin, gue bikin gue ya.

227
00:12:07,197 --> 00:12:10,152
Iya, kayak Kinan. Nunggu numpuk dulu.

228
00:12:10,187 --> 00:12:11,382
Kayak... Kayak

229
00:12:11,417 --> 00:12:16,102
Paling jauh, gue ceritanya
sama mamah gue sih.

230
00:12:16,137 --> 00:12:17,677
Lain, lain-lain.

231
00:12:28,067 --> 00:12:29,507
Boleh, boleh, boleh.

232
00:12:31,107 --> 00:12:32,132
Coba, Fajar

233
00:12:32,167 --> 00:12:38,177
Jujur, gue orangnya gak
terlalu suka cerita ke orang.

234
00:12:38,837 --> 00:12:42,042
Apapun itu masalahnya,
walaupun hal sekecil apapun,

235
00:12:42,077 --> 00:12:45,497
Hal sebesar apapuna kayak...
Jaranglah gua cerita ke orang.

236
00:12:46,237 --> 00:12:50,397
Mungkin kalau misalkan, gua ngerasa
bener-bener nyaman sama orang gitu.

237
00:12:51,117 --> 00:12:52,217
Sekarang ada ga mungkin?

238
00:12:52,777 --> 00:12:53,497
Aduh,

239
00:12:58,237 --> 00:13:00,177
Mungkin kalau misalkan cerita di orang

240
00:13:00,767 --> 00:13:06,732
Kalau gue udah bener-bener percaya
sama orang itu, baru gue cerita.

241
00:13:06,767 --> 00:13:07,547
Usah dibahasin gitu.

242
00:13:17,807 --> 00:13:22,092
Cerita pada saat otak lagi numpuk-numpuknya
tuh kayak ada hal-hal yang kayak

243
00:13:22,127 --> 00:13:25,747
Mis ya, kayak terlalu
di umbar-umbarkan banget juga sih.

244
00:13:25,827 --> 00:13:27,492
Jadi gua lebih baik kayak...

245
00:13:27,527 --> 00:13:32,732
Gue saring dulu, tenangin diri.
Baru gue cerita ke seseorang.

246
00:13:32,767 --> 00:13:33,767
Omongin ya? Betul.

247
00:13:35,477 --> 00:13:36,337
Kalau dari Cero?

248
00:13:36,577 --> 00:13:37,417
Ya, Cero sih.

249
00:13:38,377 --> 00:13:39,117
Masa lu

250
00:13:40,487 --> 00:13:41,837
Gue mau tahu nih, cerita lo gimana.

251
00:13:42,407 --> 00:13:43,817
Kalau gue sama kayak Fajar.

252
00:13:44,067 --> 00:13:46,387
Maksudnya, gue orang yang jarang cerita.

253
00:13:46,417 --> 00:13:48,342
Bukan gak pernah sih jarang banget cerita.

254
00:13:48,377 --> 00:13:52,977
Iya kan? Iya karena, menurut gue tuh
gue lebih suka mending semuanya sendiri,

255
00:13:53,217 --> 00:13:55,497
Nanti kalau emang misalkan
udah bener-bener cap.

256
00:13:55,627 --> 00:14:02,187
Ada teman baik gue dari SMA.
Gue bisa cerita ke dia.
